  Actual URL:   http://example.com/api?a%3db%26c%3dd
  Expected URL: http://example.com/api?a%3db%26c%3dd
  [+] VERDICT: [ PASS ]

---[ Test 3: Bug Part B (Append + URL-Encode) ]---
  Input Query: "a=b&c=d"
